// ============================================

// 1. Add to chart as indicator (not overlay)
// 2. Monitor histogram color (Green=Safe, Yellow=Caution, Red=Exit)
// 3. Set alerts for risk thresholds
// 4. Exit long positions when risk > 70%
// 5. Avoid new longs when risk > 50%
// 6. Re-enter when risk < 30%

